{"about_the_game":"It's a first-person platformer puzzle game similar to Portal, with a rich story, a suspenseful atmosphere, and a bit of a thriller.<br />\r\nIn the game, the mirror is a door that allows you to move through two Spaces that mirror each other.<br />\r\nYou will gain the ability to open mirrors and use that ability to solve puzzles.<br />\r\nIn the process, you can read and experience a dark story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. Solving puzzles.<br />\r\nSimilar to Portal, you will have the ability to open mirror doors.<br />\r\n2. Salute the Portal.<br />\r\nThere are puzzle elements common to Portal, such as cubes, energy pellets, and bounces.<br />\r\n3. Rich story.<br />\r\nExperience a suspenseful story, the atmosphere is weird, a little scary, especially at the end.<br />\r\n4. Realistic style Graphics.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1967170?t=1747360757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1967170?t=1747360757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967170/de97dec09cc67c9354ad8f50839a6f721ce914fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747360757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967170/de97dec09cc67c9354ad8f50839a6f721ce914fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747360757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"including violence and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3672030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"It's a first-person platformer puzzle game similar to Portal, with a rich story, a suspenseful atmosphere, and a bit of a thriller.<br />\r\nIn the game, the mirror is a door that allows you to move through two Spaces that mi